  "description": "Free, MIT-licensed fluent assertions for .NET. Drop-in-friendly Should() syntax for xUnit, NUnit, and MSTest with AssertionScope, deep BeEquivalentTo diffs, snapshot testing, and AOT-safe runtime behavior.",
